PlotPilot-Pluginized P0 integration baseline

The existing PlotPilot product source and its original notices remain governed
by LICENSE.  P0 adds contract, SDK, fixture, verification and integration
evidence files; it does not copy third-party source code into this repository.

Third-party dependency names, exact lock metadata, license identifiers,
resolved URLs and integrity values are recorded in:

  docs/deliveries/PPA-00/license-ledger.json

The checked-in contracts/unicode-casefold-v1.json runtime table is generated
from CPython unicodedata backed by the Unicode Character Database (UCD) 15.0.0
and is distributed under the Unicode Data Files and Software License:

  https://www.unicode.org/license.txt

Its generator, source, version and artifact record are kept in
docs/deliveries/PPA-00/license-ledger.json.

The frontend dependency lock used for the M0 baseline is frontend/package-lock.json
and the workspace lock is pnpm-lock.yaml.  Downstream projects must preserve
the notices of any new dependency and update the ledger through a Dependency
Delta before merge.
